        "product_summary": "Plain-toe Derby profile: An uncluttered rounded vamp and separate open-lacing quarters create a casual Derby shape.\n\nLace-up adjustment: Four visible lace rows let the buyer adjust the fastening across the instep.\n\nChunky sole edge: A substantial sidewall and deep edge notches give the low-top shoe a pronounced silhouette for contemporary casual outfits.\n\nTwo neutral colour directions: Black and Camel are listed in EU39-46 for colour-size assortment planning.\n\nWholesale planning: Send colour-size quantities, packing preference and destination for an order quotation.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
